{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜港姐從化外景「10秒急才大考驗」迎來最後一彈！今次由師姐麥美恩（Mayanne）親自出馬，突擊搜查2號李澤欣（Scarlett）與11號顏懿菲（Agnes）的房間，要求兩位佳麗在10秒限時內，迅速找出三件最「無聊」的物品。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">面對師姐的考驗，Agnes 率先出招！她一邊比劃著自己，一邊自認是一個「無趣的人」。不過，Mayanne 隨即對她作出靈魂拷問，直指「無趣並不代表無聊」。面對師姐如此犀利的反問，未知 Agnes 會如何巧妙應對？</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"0964aeaf-32ad-4218-b44e-8371b0483aa9.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026pq7Tfwf5uM1786934840.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0964aeaf-32ad-4218-b44e-8371b0483aa9.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一邊廂，Scarlett 迅速找出的三件無聊物件分別是：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">垃圾袋</p></li><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"ba9e857e-ed0b-4257-a177-97cb0d58dc1f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026xlOmMRhEsA1786934840.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ba9e857e-ed0b-4257-a177-97cb0d58dc1f.png.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T05:05:58.119999+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}